  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.5186767578125,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "should be made to ensure access to approved rapid molecular tests. Until the capacity for second-line",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.972314834594727,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.4124145507812,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "DST – including for bedaquiline, linezolid and clofazimine – becomes available, treatment decisions",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.4442749023438,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "may need to rely on the likelihood of resistance to medicines, based on an individual patient’s clinical",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        330.8335266113281,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "history and surveillance data from the country or region.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        128.69459533691406,
        527.4156494140625,
        143.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "The analysis for the three PICO questions on the duration of treatment did not show any differences",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        141.8946075439453,
        527.4447631835938,
        156.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "overall in treatment failure or relapse when comparing patients with MDR-TB with or without additional",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.952949523925781,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09474182128906,
        527.1571655273438,
        169.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "second-line drug resistance, including those with additional resistance to fluoroquinolones and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.29469299316406,
        527.3847045898438,
        182.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "injectable agents. In patients with resistance to amikacin and streptomycin, Recommendation 3.17",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.4947052001953,
        524.3676147460938,
        195.9376983642578
      ],
      "text": "does not apply. The duration of treatment may need to be longer than 20 months overall in MDR/",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.69471740722656,
        490.2818603515625,
        209.13771057128906
      ],
      "text": "RR-TB cases with extended resistance patterns, subject to the clinical response to treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        225.53858947753906,
        196.74729919433594,
        241.19857788085938
      ],
      "text": "Rifampicin-resistant TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        248.40650939941406,
        527.5842895507812,
        262.8495178222656
      ],
      "text": "A patient (child or adult) in whom isoniazid resistance is absent needs to be treated with a recommended",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        261.60650634765625,
        527.4432373046875,
        276.0495300292969
      ],
      "text": "MDR-TB regimen – either a longer MDR-TB regimen to which isoniazid is added, or a shorter MDR-TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.966548919677734,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        240.006103515625,
        274.696533203125,
        518.8550415039062,
        289.051513671875
      ],
      "text": "Treatment of drug-resistant TB using 6-month regimens",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        274.8065185546875,
        527.4190673828125,
        289.2495422363281
      ],
      "text": "regimen in eligible patients (see also ).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        288.00653076171875,
        527.0970458984375,
        302.4495544433594
      ],
      "text": "Although high-dose isoniazid is not included in Groups A–C, given the rarity of its use in contemporary",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.955911636352539,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        301.20648193359375,
        527.203369140625,
        315.6495056152344
      ],
      "text": "longer regimens for adults with MDR/RR-TB, it may still be used in patients with confirmed susceptibility",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.948328971862793,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        313.1304931640625,
        524.4166259765625,
        328.8495178222656
      ],
      "text": "(82) or in the presence of mutations that do not usually confer complete resistance to isoniazid  . High-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.98478889465332,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        327.60650634765625,
        527.3858642578125,
        342.0495300292969
      ],
      "text": "dose isoniazid was shown to be an important component in paediatric regimens in a 2016 evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.530517578125,
        527.4234619140625,
        355.2495422363281
      ],
      "text": "(71) review of the WHO guidelines; based on this finding its use in adults was extrapolated  . In this",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        354.0065002441406,
        527.4400634765625,
        368.44952392578125
      ],
      "text": "analysis, high-dose isoniazid was associated with treatment success among children with confirmed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        365.9305114746094,
        374.359375,
        381.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "P MDR-TB (aOR: 5.9, 95% confidence limits [CL]: 1.7–20.5,  =0.007).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        398.05029296875,
        207.4549102783203,
        413.7102966308594
      ],
      "text": "Children and adolescents",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        420.9183044433594,
        527.4365234375,
        435.361328125
      ],
      "text": "The 2018 IPD of longer regimens comprised mainly data from adult patients, with only 181 of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        434.1183166503906,
        527.2308959960938,
        448.56134033203125
      ],
      "text": "13 104 (1.4%) cases being in children and adolescents aged below 15 years. Nonetheless, WHO",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        447.31829833984375,
        527.3916015625,
        461.7613220214844
      ],
      "text": "recommendations on longer MDR-TB regimens apply to children as well as adults. Most medicines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        460.518310546875,
        527.3959350585938,
        474.9613342285156
      ],
      "text": "that are used in longer regimens have been part of MDR-TB regimens for many years, in similar",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        473.7182922363281,
        527.5648193359375,
        488.16131591796875
      ],
      "text": "combinations, for both adults and children. The GDG 2021 recommended the use of bedaquiline and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98373794555664,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        485.6423034667969,
        527.5187377929688,
        501.361328125
      ],
      "text": "(30) delamanid in children of all ages  . Reproducing the delamanid exposure achieved with the special",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.985589981079102,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        500.1183166503906,
        527.4466552734375,
        514.5613403320312
      ],
      "text": "25 mg tablet tested in the trial in children aged 3–5 years is expected to be challenging, given that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        513.3182983398438,
        527.4387817382812,
        527.7612915039062
      ],
      "text": "this formulation is not bioequivalent with the 50 mg delamanid adult tablet – the only preparation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        525.2423095703125,
        527.4867553710938,
        540.9613037109375
      ],
      "text": "(2) available at that time  . There are also concerns that the adult tablet may shatter if attempts are made",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.957366943359375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        539.71826171875,
        527.4541015625,
        554.1612548828125
      ],
      "text": "to split it, and that its contents are exceedingly bitter and unpalatable. Further, bioavailability may be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        552.9183349609375,
        527.5523071289062,
        567.361328125
      ],
      "text": "altered when the 50 mg tablet is split, crushed or dissolved. Delamanid is susceptible to oxidation and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.983287811279297,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        566.1182861328125,
        527.3915405273438,
        580.561279296875
      ],
      "text": "heat; therefore, retaining pill fragments for use at a time other than the time of initial administration",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        579.3182983398438,
        527.3893432617188,
        593.7612915039062
      ],
      "text": "is likely to result in the delivery of lower-than-expected active compound and unspecified oxidation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        592.518310546875,
        132.05029296875,
        606.9613037109375
      ],
      "text": "by-products.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        614.22216796875,
        527.5822143554688,
        628.6651611328125
      ],
      "text": "The avoidance of an injectable-containing regimen is particularly desirable in children, especially those",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.964442253112793,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        627.4222412109375,
        527.41357421875,
        641.865234375
      ],
      "text": "who are very young and those with mild disease (as determined by the absence of malnutrition),",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        640.6221923828125,
        527.4376831054688,
        655.065185546875
      ],
      "text": "serious forms of extrapulmonary disease, cavitation on chest radiography or HIV infection. Hearing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        653.8223266601562,
        527.4332275390625,
        668.2653198242188
      ],
      "text": "loss can have a permanent effect on the acquisition of language and the ability to learn at school;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        667.022216796875,
        521.4515380859375,
        681.4652099609375
      ],
      "text": "therefore, if amikacin or streptomycin use is resorted to in children, regular audiometry is required.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        688.7261962890625,
        527.442138671875,
        703.169189453125
      ],
      "text": "The recommendations on treatment duration apply also to children. Given that many patients in the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        701.9262084960938,
        527.6206665039062,
        716.3692016601562
      ],
      "text": "paediatric age group may only be clinically diagnosed or have extrapulmonary disease, it is expected",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.990996360778809,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        715.126220703125,
        527.2946166992188,
        729.5692138671875
      ],
      "text": "that treatment duration will largely be guided by Recommendation 3.15, subject to response to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        728.326171875,
        527.4332885742188,
        742.7691650390625
      ],
      "text": "treatment. Shortening the total treatment duration to less than 18 months may be considered in the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        741.4161987304688,
        348.252685546875,
        755.9691772460938
      ],
      "text": "Definitions case of children without extensive disease (see ).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        39.172698974609375,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "132 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
